    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a street so lonely, in a town so quiet, stands a mall no more, but a place for the old and unwanted, in plain sight to all, but very few enthralled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet in this dimness, a strange sight does appear, the building's windows aglow, as if to cheer, amidst the darkness, they shine so clear, a beacon of hope, dispelling fear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When night is broken, the end is awoken, but until then, don't run too fast, don't be too rash, Or your demise might arise. That, I am certain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Horror Cartridge Collection is a series of short form horror games in the PSX style, with each game (Cartridge) offering a unique experience with different gameplay mechanics, styles and stories all connected by the mall. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the Mall </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game Achievements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple Endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable Retro Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developer Commentary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cheats</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Found Cartridges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c1ffba4af9c444769ee44f1f6a3a4557.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c1ffba4af9c444769ee44f1f6a3a4557.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c1ffba4af9c444769ee44f1f6a3a4557.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Out Of Gas</strong></p><p class=