- Packaging - Time limit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Eternal Storage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have just purchased an abandoned storage unit and have arrived at the facility to clear it out, find the unit and start clearing out all the junk, keep your eye out for anything that looks valuable, you never know what you might find.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 52 Minutes\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Endings - 2\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Collectables - 1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person - Unpacking - Dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resolve Your Fate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious book has been left at the door, but beware the power that's 