52\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/a02766b79f8a3797febda66c91450dd1.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/a02766b79f8a3797febda66c91450dd1.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>M.A.D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's the height of the Cold War and the launch order has just been sent. Take control of your launch control center and perform your duty to your country.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 3 Minutes\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Endings - 3\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Collectables - 1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person - Typing - Nuclear war - Time limit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/9b153880ea1000cb4c8d55fe9dfad92c.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/9b153880ea1000cb4c8d55fe9dfad92c.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/9b153880ea1000cb4c8d55fe9dfad92c.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Santa's Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's Christmas eve and all the toys have been assembled, but now they need to be packaged and put into Santa's bag for delivery. You are a freshly hired elf tasked with taking the assembled toys and packaging them ready for children to open on Christmas day, work fast, midnight is approaching.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 5 Minutes\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Endings - 3 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person - Sorting - Packaging - Time limit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/c49f13dafcb169038abe49b154d73125.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Eternal Storage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have just purchased an abandoned storage unit and have arrived at the facility to clear it out, find the unit and start clearing out all the junk, keep your eye out for anything that looks valuable, you never know what you might find.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 52 Minutes\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Endings - 2\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Collectables - 1 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person - Unpacking - Dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/1376dc9a2f9e8a316bbb293941fcef5b.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resolve Your Fate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mysterious book has been left at the door, but beware the power that's held inside. Can you overcome the curse and free yourself? Or will you succumb and meet your fate.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 70 Minutes\u00a0<strong>|\u00a0</strong>Endings - 9  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choices Matter - Text based</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/5e7d3756b73e71e8c790d5714e56ea9c.poster.avif?t=1750691052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/5e7d3756b73e71e8c790d5714e56ea9c.webm?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1873140/extras/5e7d3756b73e71e8c790d5714e56ea9c.mp4?t=1750691052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Long Barrow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four to be laid to rest. Take them to the long barrow and find a spot inside for each one. Get it done quick before the sun goes down, the dead don\u2019t like to be disturbed at night. And be wary of speaking to the dead, they may answer you back.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtime - 15 Minutes | Endings - 1 | Collectables - 1</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First Person - Dialogue - Comedy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Notice about translations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Translations from English to other languages has been done by automated service, as such translations may contain errors and are not 100% accurate.</p>",
